    "question": {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
        "text": "Will MiroShark receive its first external pull request by November 30, 2026?",
        "level": "h2"
      }
    },
    "sep1": {
      "type": "Separator",
      "props": {
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    "coord_section": {
      "type": "Stack",
      "props": {
        "direction": "vertical",
        "gap": "md"
      },
      "children": [
        "coord_head",
        "coord_body"
      ]
    },
    "coord_head": {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
        "text": "The Coordination Play",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "coord_body": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "304 forks sit on GitHub. Not one has ever submitted a PR back. This market turns \"I forked it once\" into \"I should actually contribute.\" Every developer who cloned the repo is a potential resolver — they just need a reason to come back. First-mover prestige in a zero-contribution repo is a unique flex. An AI agent can maintain the codebase, but it cannot pretend to be an outside contributor. Only a human can close this market YES."
      }
    },
    "sep2": {
      "type": "Separator",
      "props": {
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    "why_section": {
      "type": "Stack",
      "props": {
        "direction": "vertical",
        "gap": "md"
      },
      "children": [
        "why_head",
        "why_body"
      ]
    },
    "why_head": {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
        "text": "Why Now",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "why_body": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "The Oct 25 article \"Three Hundred Forks. Zero Pull Requests\" crystallized the anomaly. CMU research shows 50% of forks never contribute upstream — MiroShark sits at 0% across 304 forks while an autonomous agent has filed 80 self-improve PRs in 220 days. The maintenance loop may have eliminated the perceived need, or raised the bar. Either way, 304 ghosts and not one has come back."
      }
    },
    "sep3": {
      "type": "Separator",
      "props": {
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    "resolution_section": {
      "type": "Stack",
      "props": {
        "direction": "vertical",
        "gap": "md"
      },
      "children": [
        "res_head",
        "res_body"
      ]
    },
    "res_head": {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
        "text": "Resolution",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "res_body": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "A pull request submitted to aaronjmars/MiroShark from a GitHub account not associated with the core team, containing substantive code changes (not typo-only or bot-generated), merged or open by 23:59 UTC November 30, 2026."
      }
    },
